#adr #豎ｺ螳・謗｡逕ｨ

**Decision.** The user's only involvement is the request form (tools/agentflow, inbox/requests). Claude specs it, asks ChatGPT for textures/specs via Chrome, downloads the images, runs coder-light/standard/heavy in parallel, builds and verifies 窶・no confirmation questions in between.
**Still confirm.** Destructive/irreversible actions, spending money, security-relevant changes (CLAUDE.md ﾂｧ24).
**Why.** User found per-step approval unnecessary. **How to apply.** Decide design choices yourself (record them with `flow.py log --kind decision`), report at the end.
Related: [[architecture]].
